    "peer_reviewed": "preprint",
    "problems": "The paper does not directly measure refusal on harmless prompts or test the claimed single residual-stream direction across all layers and positions. Table 4 gives no unsteered ASR reference for the ablation comparisons. Jailbreak ASR is judged by Meta Llama Guard 3; the paper also notes that some feature-map settings can produce degenerate generations that may be misclassified as successful steering.",
    "rows_left_out": "Not included: HiDRA-versus-baseline results as results of the paper's new method, general-capability benchmark scores, and truthfulness/CAA outcomes. These do not test the claimed refusal direction; the paper's own jailbreak-direction results are represented by the reported direct-method baselines.",
    "untested": [
      {
