    "verdict_notes": "The ASR judge is Llama Guard 3. The authors note that degenerate generations can be misclassified as successful, as with the Cube/Cubic maps and low LeakyReLU slopes. The original source (Arditi et al.) is cited only as the source of the DiM extraction and directional-ablation baselines."
